{"id":"u-8a5c7f13-2474-4052-b7d4-bdeefae9a240","src":"community","title":"The Bulked-garian Split Squatter","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/FQ4V1Y-bulked-aryan","desc":"Program for advanced lifters, that know how to regulate the weight, sets and reps by themselves.\n\nThe program is meant to be a period of increased volume: building muscle mass and work capacity, before going into a training block for strength/power/1 rep maxing.\n\nIt is open for a lot of selfadjustement with the choice of accessory lifts, as well as which of the lifts you are most interested in 'optimising for'.\nYou could fx easily decide not to add weight to an 'accessory lift' through out the whole program, even though it says to do so, because the volume is already so high. You could even go down in weight on some. The point is just getting a lot of volume.\n\nThe program would also work well as an 8 week program, where you have 3 week period of adding weight, 1 off week, and then repeat.\nThere are plenty of suggested exercises and combinations in the program, to make this alteration.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":100,"joins":5,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-22T06:19:26.648Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Power Clean","sets":[{"r":2}],"note":"Build up to a heavy double"},{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"One Arm Cable Pull Down","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pistol Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Clean Pull","sets":[{"r":5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"One Legged Glute-Back Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"V-Up","sets":[{"r":21,"x":4}]},{"n":"Side Crunch","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}],"note":"Hvis man gider supersette dem"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Barbell)","se